{"id":"628150","name":"红薯花样馒头","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/628150/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红薯","amount":"1个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"高筋粉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"},{"name":"糖","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"地瓜红薯蒸熟去皮备用。","img":"images/628150/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入料理机。","img":"images/628150/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"打成泥，多打一会减少颗粒。","img":"images/628150/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加一小半高筋粉大约200g。","img":"images/628150/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"第一次加粉打出来的效果。","img":"images/628150/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再加入200g左右的高筋粉。","img":"images/628150/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"第二次加面粉打出来的效果。","img":"images/628150/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加100g干粉取出来。","img":"images/628150/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"揉搓成面团。","img":"images/628150/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖湿布。","img":"images/628150/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖盖子醒20分钟。","img":"images/628150/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"温水融化酵母。","img":"images/628150/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入醒好的面团。","img":"images/628150/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"揉搓。","img":"images/628150/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"再次揉成光滑的面团放入容器中，盖盖子醒发。","img":"images/628150/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/628150/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"分成等份。","img":"images/628150/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"擀成长条的饼，像这样用刀切开，上面留一部分不切断。","img":"images/628150/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"卷起。","img":"images/628150/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"卷好后对折。","img":"images/628150/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"照样子做三个。","img":"images/628150/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"用筷子夹一下。","img":"images/628150/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"收口。","img":"images/628150/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"夹紧","img":"images/628150/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"塞一个大枣。","img":"images/628150/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"铺油纸摆好。盖锅盖二次发酵半小时。开火，水开15分钟关火。焖五分钟开盖取出。","img":"images/628150/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"一起吃饭吧！","img":"images/628150/step_27.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}